@*
    Home page strategic-partner strip (docs/plans/home-partners-marquee.md). Presentation only —
    the eyebrow and the data-reveal wrapper stay in Home.razor.

    - D7: the band scrolls only from MarqueeMinCount (3) visible partners. With 1-2 it is a static,
      centred, wrapping row with one copy and no pause button — repeating one or two logos 4-8 times
      to fill a loop reads as filler.
    - D8: the loop is Copies identical lists, each translating by exactly its own width
      (@keyframes hpartner-scroll in nf-pages.css), so the seam is invisible. Copy 0 is the real
      one; copies 1+ are aria-hidden and their links tabindex="-1". Copies = 1 + ceil(8 / count)
      guarantees (Copies - 1) x listWidth covers the widest viewport. MinSlotsPerLoop is COUPLED
      to nf-pages.css's ".hpartner__item { min-inline-size: 9rem }" and "--hpartner-gap: 3.5rem"
      (about 200px per slot x 8 >= the 1184px maximum viewport) — change one, revisit the other.
    - D11: pause on hover (hover-capable devices), on :focus-within, and via the explicit toggle
      below (WCAG 2.2.2, same reasoning as TestimonialCarousel.razor). State is rendered as
      data-paused on the viewport and aria-pressed on the button — never a Razor class expression.
      The toggle is inert until the circuit connects; hover/focus still pause before then.
    - D12: keyboard focus on a partner link unrolls the band into the static layout via
      ".hpartner__viewport:has(a:focus-visible)", so a focused link can never be clipped.
    - D13: under prefers-reduced-motion the CSS gives the lists an explicit "animation: none"
      (nf.css only shortens durations, which would make an infinite loop spin ~1000x/s), wraps
      them, and hides the copies and the toggle.

    Never put data-reveal or .draw on anything in here: the viewport carries Razor-driven
    attributes and the reveal wrapper in Home.razor already covers the whole band.
*@
@using NieFarm.Application.Features.Partners.Dtos

<div class="hpartner__strip">
    <div class="hpartner__viewport" data-motion="@(IsMarquee ? "marquee" : "static")"
         data-paused="@(_paused ? "true" : null)" style="--count:@Items.Count">
        @for (var copy = 0; copy < Copies; copy++)
        {
            var hidden = copy > 0;
            <ul class="hpartner__list" role="list" aria-hidden="@(hidden ? "true" : null)" @key="copy">
                @foreach (var partner in Items)
                {
                    <li class="hpartner__item" @key="partner.Id">
                        @if (partner.WebsiteUrl is not null)
                        {
                            <a class="hpartner__link" href="@partner.WebsiteUrl" target="_blank"
                               rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="@(hidden ? "-1" : null)">
                                @_mark(partner)<span class="sr-only"> (mở trong thẻ mới)</span>
                            </a>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <span class="hpartner__link">@_mark(partner)</span>
                        }
                    </li>
                }
            </ul>
        }
    </div>
    @if (IsMarquee)
    {
        <button class="hpartner__toggle" type="button" aria-label="Tạm dừng dải đối tác"
                aria-pressed="@(_paused ? "true" : "false")" @onclick="() => _paused = !_paused">
            <NfIcon Name="@(_paused ? "play" : "pause")" Size="16" />
        </button>
    }
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>Fewer visible partners than this render as a static row (D7).</summary>
    private const int MarqueeMinCount = 3;

    /// <summary>
    /// Slots one loop must span to cover the widest viewport (D8). Coupled to nf-pages.css's
    /// ".hpartner__item" min-inline-size (9rem) and "--hpartner-gap" (3.5rem).
    /// </summary>
    private const int MinSlotsPerLoop = 8;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public IReadOnlyList<PartnerDto> Items { get; set; } = [];

    private bool _paused;

    private bool IsMarquee => Items.Count >= MarqueeMinCount;

    private int Copies => IsMarquee ? 1 + (int)Math.Ceiling(MinSlotsPerLoop / (double)Items.Count) : 1;

    /// <summary>The logo when there is one (alt = Name), otherwise the name as a text wordmark (D15).</summary>
    private readonly RenderFragment<PartnerDto> _mark = p =>
        @<text>@if (p.LogoUrl is not null)
        {
            <img class="hpartner__logo" src="@p.LogoUrl" alt="@p.Name" decoding="async" />
        }
        else
        {
            <span class="hpartner__mark">@p.Name</span>
        }</text>;
}
